Are you an experienced Reach Truck Driver looking for a new opportunity? We are currently recruiting for a modern logistics company in Helmond. As a Reach Truck Driver, you will be responsible for safely and efficiently moving goods throughout the warehouse while supporting daily logistics operations using modern equipment.

Your responsibilities:

- Operating a reach truck at heights of up to 12 meters;
- Moving and storing pallets throughout the warehouse;
- Picking orders using the reach truck;
- Scanning, labeling, and wrapping pallets;
- Checking orders before shipment;
- Supporting Value Added Services (VAS) activities;
- Maintaining a clean, safe, and organized working environment.

Working Hours in the day shift: 07:00 AM – 04:00 PM. During peak periods in July till October, a two-shift schedule may be required. (6:00-15:00/15:00-00:00)

- Holds a valid Reach Truck certificate;
- Is comfortable working at heights up to 12 meters;
- Fulltime available;
- Living nearby Helmond, Mierlo, Geldrop, Nuenen or Eindhoven;
- Has experience in logistics and safety;
- Is flexible regarding tasks and working hours;
- Has a good command of Dutch and/or English.

The position
As an electrician, you will work in a team of over 40 technicians as part of Technical Services. You will independently carry out repairs, maintenance, commissioning and periodic safety inspections of electrical construction machinery and/or aerial work platforms so that they can be used optimally, efficiently and functionally.

Your tasks and responsibilities

  - Troubleshooting;

  - Analysing malfunctions;

  - Troubleshooting faults using electronic and hydraulic diagrams;

  - Performing maintenance checks;

  - Performing repairs;

  - Performing on-site inspections;

  - Keeping workplace/environment clean and tidy.

Our offer

  - Market-based salary and working conditions according to the Collective Labour Agreement for Metalworking;

  - We have a 40-hour working week and, according to the collective labour agreement, you can choose between the full commutation of ADV or 13 ADV days per year;

  - Discounts on products and services with the Employee Benefit Programme;

  - Free access to SnowWorld;

  - Holiday pay, training opportunities, bicycle plan, fitness plan, overtime compensation (free time or money), ...;

  - 26-leave days and the possibility to buy an additional 8 leave days;

  - Monthly Friday afternoon drinks in our in-house café;

  - The opportunity to attend various events for free;

  - Being part of our informal Collé family.

Your profile.

  - MBO working and thinking level, obtained through a technical education such as mechatronics or agricultural mechanisation;

  - Technical knowledge, experience and insight in the field of electro and hydraulics;

  - Problem-solving and analytical skills, service-oriented;

  - Sense of responsibility, flexible, independent and also a team player;

  - Sufficient command of the Dutch language. We also invite suitable candidates with a command of the English and/or German language who are willing to learn Dutch;

  - Living in the Sittard region.

Interested?
Don't wait any
